msgstr "Otevřít %1"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7556
msgid "Get %1"
msgstr "Získat %1"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7574
msgid ""
"A folder Windows has too, as Shared with Monet: save a download, a mod or an installer there once, and it's in both. Files lists it with your places."
msgstr ""
"Složka, kterou mají i Windows, jako „Shared with Monet“: uložte do ní jednou stažený soubor, mod nebo instalátor a máte ho v obou. Soubory ji ukazují mezi vašimi místy."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7584
msgid "Where your games are"
msgstr "Kde máte hry"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7610
msgid "Steam, Heroic and Lutris keep theirs here once you install one"
msgstr ""
"Steam, Heroic a Lutris sem ukládají své hry, jakmile některý z nich nainstalujete"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7617
msgid "Needs Windows"
msgstr "Potřebuje Windows"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7631
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. It's in Windows games, ready there."
msgstr ""
"Její anti-cheat povoluje jen Windows. Je v „Windows games“, připravená tam."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7632
msgid "Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. It's there too."
msgstr "Její anti-cheat povoluje jen Windows. Je i tam."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7633
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. In Steam, move it to Windows games (Properties, Installed Files, Move install folder), and it's ready there."
msgstr ""
"Její anti-cheat povoluje jen Windows. Ve Steamu ji přesuňte do „Windows games“ (Vlastnosti, Nainstalované soubory, Přesunout instalační složku) a bude tam připravená."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7634
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. Install it in Windows' Steam to play."
msgstr ""
"Její anti-cheat povoluje jen Windows. Nainstalujte ji do Steamu ve Windows a hrajte."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7638
msgid "Play on Windows…"
msgstr "Hrát ve Windows…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7651
