#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:248 crates/monet/src/main.rs:339
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Choose Windows in the app menu to finish setting it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows ještě není nainstalován. Nastavení dokončíte, když v nabídce aplikací zvolíte Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:250
msgid ""
"Windows is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key in Settings › Games & Controllers, and Monet opens it and sets it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows je zašifrované nástrojem BitLocker. Zadejte jeho obnovovací klíč v Nastavení › Hry & ovladače a Monet ho otevře a nastaví."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:255
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, so Monet can't set it up yet. Open Windows, choose Restart, and Monet finishes the rest."
msgstr ""
"Windows je v režimu spánku, takže ho Monet zatím nemůže nastavit. Otevřete Windows, zvolte Restartovat a Monet dokončí zbytek."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:263
msgid "This PC didn't start in UEFI mode, so Monet can't switch to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Tento počítač se nespustil v režimu UEFI, takže Monet nemůže přepnout do Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:270 crates/monet/src/main.rs:593
msgid ""
"Windows wasn't found on this PC. Install Windows first, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Windows se v tomto počítači nenašel. Nejdřív Windows nainstalujte a pak to zkuste znovu."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:290
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "Nenalezeno"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:292
msgid "Unavailable (not a UEFI system)"
msgstr "Nedostupné (nejde o systém UEFI)"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:351
msgid "Play %1 on Windows?"
msgstr "Hrát %1 ve Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:352
msgid "Open in Windows?"
msgstr "Otevřít ve Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:353
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "Hrát ve Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:359
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows and open it. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Počítač se restartuje do Windows a otevře ji. Otevřené aplikace se zavřou."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:360
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and start the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr ""
"Váš počítač se restartuje do Windows a spustí hru. Až ji ukončíte, vrátí se zpět do Monetu."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:361
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows with your game launchers ready to sign in to. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Váš počítač se restartuje do Windows a herní launchery budou připravené k přihlášení. Otevřené aplikace se zavřou."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:362
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows, update it and your games, and switch off when they're done. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Váš počítač se restartuje do Windows, aktualizuje Windows i vaše hry a po dokončení se vypne. Otevřené aplikace se zavřou."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:363
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows. Open apps will close."
msgstr "Váš počítač se restartuje do Windows. Otevřené aplikace se zavřou."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:365
msgid ""
"Save your work first. Unsaved changes and private tabs aren't captured. Downloads stop during the restart; check Store's Downloads when you return."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:597
msgid ""
"Monet seems to have started from the Windows entry, which shouldn't happen."
msgstr "Zdá se, že se Monet spustil z položky Windows, což by se nemělo stát."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:636
msgid ""
"This PC's firmware didn't keep the switch to Windows. Restart and choose Windows in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr ""
"Firmware tohoto počítače si nezapamatoval přepnutí do Windows. Restartujte a ve spouštěcí nabídce počítače zvolte Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:667
msgid ""
"The restart was blocked. The switch to Windows was cancelled. Save your work and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:685
msgid ""
"Monet couldn't identify your desktop account. Start Windows from your desktop and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:691
msgid "Your desktop account could not be found. The switch was cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:815
msgid "This copy of Monet can't install Windows by itself."
msgstr "Tato kopie Monetu neumí sama nainstalovat Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:874
msgid ""
"Monet can install Windows from %1. Your PC restarts and Windows installs itself."
msgstr ""
"Monet může nainstalovat Windows z %1. Počítač se restartuje a Windows se nainstaluje automaticky."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:877
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Monet downloads it from Microsoft (about 7 GB) and installs it. This takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Windows ještě není nainstalován. Monet ho stáhne od Microsoftu (asi 7 GB) a nainstaluje. Zabere to asi 30 minut."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:881
msgid "Set up Windows?"
msgstr "Nastavit Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:881
msgid "Set Up"
msgstr "Nastavit"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:885
msgid "Getting Windows ready for your games"
msgstr "Připravuje se Windows pro vaše hry"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:890
msgid ""
"Monet is downloading Windows (about 7 GB). You can keep using your PC; Monet asks before it restarts."
msgstr ""
"Monet stahuje Windows (asi 7 GB). Počítač můžete dál používat – Monet se před restartem zeptá."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:920
msgid ""
"Restart now to install Windows? It takes about 10 minutes, then you're back in Monet."
msgstr ""
"Restartovat teď a nainstalovat Windows? Zabere to asi 10 minut a pak budete zpátky v Monetu."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:930
msgid ""
"The restart was blocked. Save your work, then choose Restart and install in Play on Windows."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:936
msgid "Windows setup stopped before it could use the installation media"
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:938
msgid "Open Play on Windows to retry the download or choose a Windows 11 ISO."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:939
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:948
msgid "there isn't enough free space for Windows"
msgstr "pro Windows není dost volného místa"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:949
msgid ""
"Windows needs about 72 GB of the disk to itself, and 16 GB free in Monet while it downloads."
msgstr ""
"Windows potřebuje asi 72 GB disku jen pro sebe a během stahování 16 GB volného místa v Monetu."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:954
msgid ""
"Windows couldn't be set up this time. Choose Windows in the app menu to try again."
msgstr ""
"Windows se tentokrát nepodařilo nastavit. Chcete-li to zkusit znovu, zvolte Windows v nabídce aplikací."

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:416
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC skipped Monet's one-time start. Next time, Monet asks it a different way."
msgstr ""
"Windows se nespustil: tento počítač přeskočil jednorázové spuštění od Monetu. Příště ho Monet požádá jinak."

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:429
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC couldn't open its boot entry. Next time, Monet uses another one."
msgstr ""
"Windows se nespustil: tento počítač nedokázal otevřít jeho spouštěcí položku. Příště Monet použije jinou."

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:431
msgid ""
"Windows didn't finish starting. Choose Play again to continue. If it happens again, open Settings, then Play on Windows, and choose Check."
msgstr ""
"Windows nedokončily spuštění. Pokračujte tak, že znovu zvolíte Hrát. Pokud se to stane znovu, otevřete Nastavení, pak Hrát ve Windows, a zvolte Zkontrolovat."

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:102
msgid "Windows' system disk could not be identified."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:154
msgid "This device could not be identified safely."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:214
msgid ""
"The USB device is in use or protected. Close its files and try again. Nothing was written."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:328
msgid ""
"Windows could not finish writing the USB device. It is not ready to use."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:96
